    at: 2026-10-18T00:29:15Z
    actual: 0.2d
    estimate: 1d
    accuracy: 0.22x
    gate: "7999 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed in 796.11s -- the FIRST gate run with DATABASE_URL SET; skips 12 -> 1"
    note: "Its own AC-1 was inverted and named the gutter; the implementation agent caught it against ADR-0036 and implemented OUTER. Its first gate was RED and the orchestrator's own summary line said FAILED count 0 -- a grep pattern that missed pytest's shape -- caught only by EXIT=1. Leaves the two-up lower slot without a link, which is CARD-248, dispatched on this merge."
